tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Penal Code Reform

The current Penal code remains as an anacronic relic of the Primo de Rivera's dictatorship and Alfonso XIII's monarchy. As a renowned criminologist and legal scholar, Luis Jiménez de Asúa has prepared a comprehensive overhaul of the justice system to align Spanish law with modern democratic standards. Now that the 1928's code is abolished we are back to the 1870's one. It is time to adapt the 1870's penal code to the Republican Constitution, fix errors and update different crimes and make a more humane process.

- @death_penalty: Abolish the death penalty and reform the prison system.
- @homosexuality: Decriminalize homosexuality and repeal moral offense laws.
- @head_of_state: The president is no king, and such he can be judged for his actions. 
- @various: Abolish or lower the penalty for outdated crimes.
- @return: We don't need a new penal code, we have more urgent problems.
- @submit: The new penal code is ready.
- @cancel_advisor_action

@death_penalty
view-if: repealed_dp == 0
on-arrival: repealed_dp = 1; pro_republic += 5; workers_psoe += 5; rural_psoe += 6; judicial_reform += 1;

The death penalty is abolished, it is a dangerous weapon and enough innocents have lost their life. The only exception is under military jurisdiction during war.

Of course, conservatives and the far right accuse us of "softness" with the criminals.


@homosexuality
view-if: reformed_homo == 0
on-arrival: reformed_homo = 1; homosexual_rights += 1; pro_republic += 3; middle_psoe += 5; catholics_psoe -= 10; judicial_reform += 0.5

Primo de Rivera criminalized homosexuality, it is time to revert this reactionary decision. 


@head_of_state
view-if: hod == 0
on-arrival: hod = 1; dlr_relation -= 10; pro_republic += 5; middle_psoe += 5; workers_psoe += 3; rural_psoe += 5; judicial_reform += 0.5

The king wasn't accountable of his decision as he was above the law. We don't live anymore in the Ancien Régime, the president of the republic must be hold accountable of its actions while acting as head of state.

@various
view-if: var == 0
on-arrival: var = 1; judicial_reform += 0.5

As we are updating a code from the last century, there are many crimes that are no longer relevant like smugling, piratering or trying to abolish the official religion (Catholicism). There are many laws that needs to be removed or updated. 

@submit
subtitle: The new penal code is up for the Cortes to vote it.
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have majority support for this new code.
view-if: penal_reform >= 1 and new_penal == 0
choose-if: left_republican_coalition >= 40
on-arrival: new_penal = 1; pro_republic += 5; middle_psoe += 5; workers_psoe += 6; rural_psoe += 6; polarization += 5;

The new penal code is approbed. It is, nevertheless, provisional just like the penal code of 1870 which is based on. This project is due to the urgency of reforming the old laws, new adjustments shall be done to ensure a modern and democratic rule of the law. 
